	SKP			/SUCCESS RETURN. PRINTER IS ONLINE.	/A034
	JMP	CULCK2		/ERROR RETURN. NON-EXISTENT PRINTER.	/A034

	AC0002			/SPECIFY CHECK DOCUMENT DESTINATION	/A074
