	TAD	CURWNO		/PICK OUT DRIVE NO.
	BSW
	RTR
	AND	(17)
	TAD	CURWDR		/AND COMPARE WITH DRIVE WE ARE STORING ON
	SZA CLA			/SAME ?
	JMP	CURMNX		/NO, GET NEXT ENTRY

	TAD	CURWNO		/YES, FIRST PUT INTO LIST OF FILES TO DELETE
	DCA I	CURLPP
